usage: course check [-h] [--root DIR] --station PATH [--install DIR] [--lab N] [--json]

options:
  -h, --help      show this help message and exit
  --root DIR      niagara-research checkout (default: $NIAGARA_RESEARCH_DIR, then found from cwd)
  --station PATH  station directory, or its config.bog (zipped or plain XML)
  --install DIR   Niagara install whose modules/ holds the built jars (jar checks SKIP without it)
  --lab N         only this lab (1-11, B); repeatable
  --json          machine JSON output
